+- **Issue**: `drivers/webgpu/naga-converter/out/` is a stale older build output (1,070,564 bytes), superseded by `prebuilt/` (1,053,644 bytes)
+- **Fix**: Delete `out/` directory
+- **Effort**: ~1 minute
+
