+## Priority 2: Nice to Fix, Not Blocking
+
+### Unused `glsl-out` Feature in Cargo.toml
+- **Issue**: naga-converter enables `glsl-out` feature but never uses GLSL output. Adds ~50-100KB to WASM binary.
