+
+### CI Jobs Detail
+
+| Job | Depends on | Timeout | Blocks merge? |
+|-----|-----------|---------|---------------|
+| `shader-corpus` | — | 10 min | Yes |
+| `build-webgpu` | — | 90 min | Yes |
+| `validate-spirv` | build-webgpu | 10 min | Yes |
+| `smoke-test` | build-webgpu | 15 min | Yes |
+| `scene-smoketest` | — | 20 min | Yes |
